  m_Name: AuntieCatching
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNodeData
  lines:
  - When you see a critter you want to catch you have to bash them on the head first.
    Some critters might be tougher than others.
  - Once they're stunned use a capturing doll! You will need to do a small ritual
    to get them. I'm sure you will get the hang of it quickly.
